Notation.arith.doc:
Arithmetic: every operator of the core pack; division of naturals rounds
down, `⌊(c · 2)/1⌋` with the fraction stacked, and of integers is written plainly;
`(-i)^2` keeps its parentheses, which `-i^2` has not.

